\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Compositional flash outputs at $t = 1.08$\,yr (top row) and $t = 3.00$\,yr (bottom row). \textbf  {(a, d)} Equilibrium brine salinity $m_s^\mathrm  {aq}$: the smooth radial gradient reflects salting-out proportional to CO$_2$ saturation; the pale region near the injector is the pure-CO$_2$ cell cluster where brine is absent. Colorbar is clipped at the 80th-percentile value to make the gradient visible across the domain; cells near the injector exceed the colorbar maximum. \textbf  {(b, e)} CO$_2$ mole fraction in the aqueous phase $x_{\text  {CO}_2}$: the plume interior (dark) is CO$_2$-saturated at the eCPA equilibrium value (${\approx }0.016$); the exterior (pale) is essentially CO$_2$-free. \textbf  {(c, f)} H$_2$O mole fraction in the CO$_2$-rich phase $y_{\text  {H}_2\text  {O}}$: the plume carries ${\approx }1$\% water throughout, consistent with the eCPA prediction at these conditions. White star: injector; black triangles: producers.}}{18}{figure.caption.14}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:compositions}{{9}{18}{Compositional flash outputs at $t = 1.08$\,yr (top row) and $t = 3.00$\,yr (bottom row). \textbf {(a, d)} Equilibrium brine salinity $m_s^\mathrm {aq}$: the smooth radial gradient reflects salting-out proportional to CO$_2$ saturation; the pale region near the injector is the pure-CO$_2$ cell cluster where brine is absent. Colorbar is clipped at the 80th-percentile value to make the gradient visible across the domain; cells near the injector exceed the colorbar maximum. \textbf {(b, e)} CO$_2$ mole fraction in the aqueous phase $x_{\text {CO}_2}$: the plume interior (dark) is CO$_2$-saturated at the eCPA equilibrium value (${\approx }0.016$); the exterior (pale) is essentially CO$_2$-free. \textbf {(c, f)} H$_2$O mole fraction in the CO$_2$-rich phase $y_{\text {H}_2\text {O}}$: the plume carries ${\approx }1$\% water throughout, consistent with the eCPA prediction at these conditions. White star: injector; black triangles: producers}{figure.caption.14}{}}
